{"steam_appid":3880400,"steam_name":"FRUKT","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880400/897799477/0176248072e6b6652358a0ceb1a0d3a777761067/1790443934/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790444432","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257436421/73951235611cdd3c2e726e20d47769231361ef53/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790444432","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/b83e348449f87eadd85a95823dbaa2c1985e7c82/ss_b83e348449f87eadd85a95823dbaa2c1985e7c82.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790714637","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/13ce4f4639d68d68df41bf639a9f0b8fc71e9b23/ss_13ce4f4639d68d68df41bf639a9f0b8fc71e9b23.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790714637","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/a99a04adc111ab893513ad126f14675b31caf7b5/ss_a99a04adc111ab893513ad126f14675b31caf7b5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790714637","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/ea86299165e3bccf80a3dfabc8b2e16f3e37b886/ss_ea86299165e3bccf80a3dfabc8b2e16f3e37b886.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790714637","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/d81d19899f285cf79ea4704fa966401366d16384/ss_d81d19899f285cf79ea4704fa966401366d16384.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790714637"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRUKT</strong> is a death sandbox where every kill becomes an experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill, dismember, and torment highly detailed voxel-based humanoids. Every bone breaks, every muscle tears, every organ reacts to damage. No rules, no story - only death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic dismemberment</strong>: tear off limbs, slice everything into pieces - body is fully physical and voxel-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional organs</strong>: the heart pumps blood, the brain controls the body, muscles hold strength. Hit the heart and the ragdoll will bleed out. Destroy the brain and it dies instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical balance</strong>: victims react naturally to all impacts, trying to stay on their feet and falling like real humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic movement</strong>: every step depends on muscle strength and the surface below. Break the legs and watch them fail to hold the body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880400/extras/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to support development?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add FRUKT to your Steam wishlist and don’t miss the release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to share ideas and follow updates?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TDA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TDA<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TDA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TDA</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["tripledose"],"publishers":["tripledose"],"release_date":"Sep 24, 2026"}